---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/layout/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/layout/Footer.astro';
import Container from '../components/ui/Container.astro';
import Section from '../components/ui/Section.astro';
import Badge from '../components/ui/Badge.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy" description="How Continuum Dataguard Technologies handles personal information submitted through this website.">
  <Header slot="header" />

  <Section>
    <Container class="max-w-3xl">
      <Badge>Privacy Policy</Badge>
      <h1 class="mt-6 text-4xl text-paper">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="mt-6 text-mist">
        This Privacy Policy explains how Continuum Dataguard Technologies ("Continuum", "we",
        "us") handles personal information in connection with this website.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-12 flex flex-col gap-10">
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl text-paper">Introduction</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-mist">
            This policy applies to the Continuum Dataguard Technologies website. It explains what
            personal information may be collected through the website, how it is used, and the
            choices available to you.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl text-paper">Information that may be collected</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-mist">
            The website's contact form asks for your name, email address, organisation (optional)
            and the content of your message. This information is only collected if you choose to
            submit it. We do not otherwise ask visitors to create accounts, log in, or provide
            personal information to browse the website.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl text-paper">How information is used</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-mist">
            Information submitted through the contact form is used solely to respond to your
            enquiry. We do not use this information for marketing, profiling or any purpose
            unrelated to responding to you.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl text-paper">Contact enquiries</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-mist">
            When you submit the contact form, the details you provide are used to understand and
            respond to your enquiry. We do not share the contents of your enquiry other than as
            necessary to respond to it or as required by law.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl text-paper">Website and technical information</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-mist">
            As with most websites, our hosting infrastructure may automatically process standard
            technical information — such as IP address, browser type and access times — as part
            of normal website operation. This information is not used to personally identify
            visitors.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl text-paper">Cookies and similar technologies</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-mist">
            This website does not currently use cookies or similar tracking technologies. If this
            changes in future, this policy will be updated accordingly.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl text-paper">Disclosure of information</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-mist">
            We do not sell or trade personal information. Information submitted through the
            website is only disclosed where necessary to respond to your enquiry, or where
            disclosure is required by law.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl text-paper">Data security</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-mist">
            We take reasonable measures to protect personal information submitted through this
            website against loss, misuse and unauthorised access, appropriate to the nature of
            the information involved.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl text-paper">Data retention</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-mist">
            Personal information submitted through the contact form is retained only for as long
            as is reasonably necessary to respond to your enquiry, after which it may be securely
            deleted.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl text-paper">Your rights under South African law</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-mist">
            South Africa's Protection of Personal Information Act (POPIA) gives individuals
            rights in relation to their personal information, including the right to request
            access to, correction of, or deletion of personal information held about them, and
            the right to lodge a complaint with the Information Regulator. Requests relating to
            personal information submitted through this website can be directed to Continuum
            using the contact details below.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl text-paper">Contact us about this policy</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-mist">
            Questions or requests regarding personal information can be directed to:
          </p>
          <div class="mt-4 flex flex-col gap-2">
            <p class="font-mono text-sm text-paper">Continuum Dataguard Technologies</p>
            <p class="font-mono text-sm text-mist">Durban, KwaZulu-Natal, South Africa</p>
            <a href="mailto:continuumdataguardtech@outlook.com" class="font-mono text-sm text-paper hover:text-signal">
              continuumdataguardtech@outlook.com
            </a>
            <a href="https://wa.me/27611519561" class="font-mono text-sm text-paper hover:text-signal">
              +27 61 151 9561
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl text-paper">Changes to this policy</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-mist">
            This policy may be updated from time to time to reflect changes to the website or
            applicable law. Any changes will be posted on this page.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </Container>
  </Section>

  <Footer slot="footer" />
</Layout>
